{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>והשלכתי</b> — like כראי, like כטנוף, and similar is הוי מראה, and הסיר את מראתו."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The three quoted Hebrew forms (כראי, כטנוף, הוי מראה) are left untranslated as they are cited purely as lexical parallels to the lemma; their identity is uncertain but the argument is clearly comparative."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:39.215432199Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}